Preamble
We take the protection of your personal data seriously. This Privacy Policy comprehensively informs you about which data is collected, processed, and stored when you use the Vayze App. Processing is carried out in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the German Federal Data Protection Act (BDSG).
Important change compared to previous versions: This version corrects and completes the disclosure of third-party services, data processing activities, and technical functions actually used by the App.

