Provider: Google LLC, 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043, USA
Purpose: Storage of push tokens, activity timestamps, notification logs
Data transmitted: User ID, Expo push token, platform (iOS/Android), app version, timestamp of last decision, streak count
Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR (push notifications), Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR (account management)
Privacy policy: https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy
Data transfer to third country: USA, based on EU Standard Contractual Clauses (Art. 46(2)(c) GDPR)
4.3 Firebase Cloud Functions
Provider: Google LLC, 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, Mountain View, CA 94043, USA
Purpose: Serverless logic for push notifications (streak warnings, re-engagement, broadcast, milestones)
Data processed: User ID, activity data, decision timestamps, streaks
Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR
Privacy policy: https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy
Data transfer to third country: USA, based on EU Standard Contractual Clauses (Art. 46(2)(c) GDPR)
Cloud Functions executed:

streakWarningDaily (daily 20:00 UTC): Iterates all users, checks streak status, sends warnings
reEngagementDaily (daily 10:00 UTC): Finds inactive users (7+ days without decision), sends re-engagement push
sendBroadcast (manually triggered): Enables broadcast notifications to all users
onStreakMilestone (automatically on new decisions): Sends congratulatory notifications at streak milestones
syncStreak (manually triggered by App): Synchronizes streak data between App and Firestore

4.4 Expo Push Notification Service
Provider: Expo Inc., 650 Alabama St, San Francisco, CA 94110, USA
Purpose: Technical delivery of push notifications to iOS and Android devices
Data transmitted: Expo push token, project ID, notification content (title, text)
Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR
Privacy policy: https://expo.dev/privacy
Data transfer to third country: USA, based on EU Standard Contractual Clauses (Art. 46(2)(c) GDPR)
4.5 Firebase Analytics (Optional, Currently Inactive)
